// ── art-weapons: the tools in the player's hand, 96x72 ──
// Owns CDA_ART_WEAPONS: ASCII sprite maps ({ w, h, rows }, one character per pixel, '.' transparent,
// every other character a key of CDA_PALETTE, Packet Siege's 44 colours). Uses nothing.
// Every frame is 96x72, drawn with its bottom edge on the view's bottom edge, centred (x 112, y 108
// in the 320x180 view); the sleeves run off the bottom edge in every frame, so the renderer can bob
// any frame. vw-driver-* (red-handled screwdriver, right hand): idle, atk0 (pulled back), atk1 (the
// stab, a spark at the tip). vw-probe-* (yellow tone probe with a green trace display): idle, atk0
// (the flash at the tip), atk1 (recoil). vw-degausser-* (a two-handed wand seen from behind in the
// view perspective: a copper coil across a steel core at the far end, a housing with a hazard band
// and two lamps, a handle in each fist, a cable off the bottom edge): idle, atk0 (re-armed, the coil
// hot and crackling), atk1 (the discharge fanning out, the tool kicked back), atk2 (fading). Colours
// used: N T Z k (dark work gloves) with an n N cuff, l A a (jacket sleeves), r R o (driver handle),
// y (probe body), h g G (probe display), w n N (steel), E Y o y (copper), c C v q (discharge).

